{
    "title": "Bricky Boy",
    "description": "Bricky Boy is a combination of brick-breaker and pinball game genres, represented in a very original style of handheld gaming consoles from the '90s. Combined with a 8-bit soundtrack, this game will let you enjoy the genuine feel of the long-gone gaming computers. \r\n\r\nIn Bricky Boy you will find lots of entertaining challenges like:\r\n\r\n\u2605Epic Boss Fights!\r\n\u2605Side Quests with Treasure!\r\n\u2605Tons of Unique Power Up Cards!\r\n\u2605Unlockable Bricky Boy Skins!\r\n\u2605Randomly Generated Levels!\r\n\r\nGet your Bricky Boy and start the adventure of a lifetime!",
